1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,620
May solar ka, pero may
Meralco bill ka pa rin?

2
00:00:02,970 --> 00:00:05,740
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:08,080
Sa typical
self-consumption setup,

4
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:11,470
tumutulong ang solar sa
daytime electricity use mo.

5
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:13,920
Pero kapag kulang
ang solar generation,

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,890
o gabi na at wala
kang battery,

7
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:18,200
puwede ka pa ring kumuha
ng kuryente sa grid.

8
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,390
May mga bill charges din
na hindi basta nawawala.

9
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:24,570
Kaya hindi dapat mangako
ng automatic zero bill.

10
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:30,880
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

11
00:00:31,230 --> 00:00:33,690
Life is SoLight with Solar.
